{"uid":"7d732fd3bf49cb72","name":"test_home_isolation_is_an_enforced_invariant_not_a_convention","fullName":"tests.test_skills_api#test_home_isolation_is_an_enforced_invariant_not_a_convention","historyId":"08bf9832e452fb62d9a74dd001abd94f","time":{"start":1791938249378,"stop":1791938249380,"duration":2},"description":"Every test above passes `stub_env={\"HOME\": ...}` to isolate the\n    child engine's `~/.pi/agent/skills/` from the real ambient $HOME --\n    but until task 002 that was purely a *convention* this test module\n    followed: nothing in `place_skills()` itself would have complained if\n    a call site (this one's own `engine/api.py`, or a future one) forgot\n    it and fell back to ambient $HOME (#83). This test asserts the\n    invariant directly, at the function boundary skills_engine's helpers\n    only exercise indirectly through the API: `place_skills()` refuses to\n    run at all without an explicit `home=`, and refuses a `config_dir`\n    that isn't the engine's own CONFIG_DIR -- in both cases before\n    touching any filesystem, proven by a decoy symlink under a fake home\n    that survives the refusal untouched. See\n    tests/test_skills_placement_requires_home.py for the full coverage;\n    this is the pointer from this module to that enforced invariant.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Every test above passes <code>stub_env={&quot;HOME&quot;: ...}</code> to isolate the<br />\nchild engine's <code>~/.pi/agent/skills/</code> from the real ambient $HOME --<br />\nbut until task 002 that was purely a <em>convention</em> this test module<br />\nfollowed: nothing in <code>place_skills()</code> itself would have complained if<br />\na call site (this one's own <code>engine/api.py</code>, or a future one) forgot<br />\nit and fell back to ambient $HOME (#83). This test asserts the<br />\ninvariant directly, at the function boundary skills_engine's helpers<br />\nonly exercise indirectly through the API: <code>place_skills()</code> refuses to<br />\nrun at all without an explicit <code>home=</code>, and refuses a <code>config_dir</code><br />\nthat isn't the engine's own CONFIG_DIR -- in both cases before<br />\ntouching any filesystem, proven by a decoy symlink under a fake home<br />\nthat survives the refusal untouched. See<br />\ntests/test_skills_placement_requires_home.py for the full coverage;<br />\nthis is the pointer from this module to that enforced invariant.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791937657212,"stop":1791937657213,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791937657213,"stop":1791937657213,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791938249351,"stop":1791938249352,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791938249352,"stop":1791938249360,"duration":8},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791938249360,"stop":1791938249360,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791938249361,"stop":17919382